  "prompt": "Split the products of each TV & Video category (category_id from 1 to 6, both included) into four launch quartiles within the category: quartile 1 holds the products launched earliest. The quartiles of a category differ in size by at most one product, and the larger ones come first. A product with a missing launch_date goes last in its category. When products of a category tie on launch_date, the lower product_id comes first. Return four columns, in this order: category_id, product_id, launch_date and launch_quartile. Return one row for each such product. Any row order is fine.",
